fix:
Implement an extension trait in Rust to encapsulate the behavior on the foreign type safely.
```rust
trait NaiveDateExt {
    fn next_day(&self) -> NaiveDate;
}
impl NaiveDateExt for NaiveDate {
    fn next_day(&self) -> NaiveDate {
        self.succ_opt().unwrap()
    }
}
